@host = http://localhost:5152
@orderId = 1
@productId = 1
@reservationId = 1

### Paginated orders with nested customer and items; inspect X-Total-Count
GET {{host}}/api/orders?page=1&pageSize=10

### Related entities
GET {{host}}/api/products?page=1&pageSize=10

### Create an order for an existing customer
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 2
}

### Set available stock to its actual value
PATCH {{host}}/api/products/{{productId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stockQuantity": 10
}

### Reserve stock; use the returned reservation ID below
POST {{host}}/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": {{orderId}},
  "productId": {{productId}},
  "quantity": 2
}

### Read the reservation and related records
GET {{host}}/api/reservations/{{reservationId}}

### Full update of writable reservation fields; stock changes by the difference
PUT {{host}}/api/reservations/{{reservationId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 3
}

### Partial update
PATCH {{host}}/api/reservations/{{reservationId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 1
}

### Insufficient stock returns 409 with ProblemDetails
POST {{host}}/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": {{orderId}},
  "productId": {{productId}},
  "quantity": 2147483647
}

### Cancel and restore stock; repeating this request returns 404
POST {{host}}/api/reservations/{{reservationId}}/cancel

### Delete the cancelled event
DELETE {{host}}/api/reservations/{{reservationId}}

### Invalid quantities return 400
POST {{host}}/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": {{orderId}},
  "productId": {{productId}},
  "quantity": 0
}
